      body('Both drivers and passengers subscribe to the notifications table via Supabase Realtime channels scoped to their user_id. The channel subscription is established on login and torn down on logout. The notification bell badge increments on every INSERT event. Clicking a notification marks it read via an UPDATE and the badge decrements.'),
