      h2('9.1 Why No Backend Server'),
      body('PamojaRide has no Express, Fastify, or Django backend. All server-side logic runs in Supabase Edge Functions (Deno) or Postgres functions. This decision has major implications:'),
      bullet('Zero server management — no VMs, no Kubernetes, no uptime monitoring for application servers. Supabase handles all infrastructure.', 0),
      bullet('Horizontal scaling is automatic — Edge Functions scale to zero and back up with no configuration.', 0),
      bullet('The only external API calls (Daraja, Smile Identity, Africa\'s Talking) happen inside Edge Functions where secrets are safely stored. They never happen from client code.', 0),
      bullet('The trade-off: complex server-side workflows (payout batching, fraud scoring) require more sophisticated Postgres function design. Worth it for the simplicity gained.', 0),
